sequenceDiagram
    participant B as VPN broker
    participant K as Kubernetes profile API
    participant P as Provider / certificate work
    B->>K: Read profile snapshot UID U, version V
    K-->>B: Desired generation G and current status
    B->>P: Select / certify for snapshot G
    Note over B,K: Name can be recreated or its version can change
    P-->>B: Result for the earlier snapshot
    B->>K: PATCH status with UID U and version V
    alt Exact observed object is current
        K-->>B: Publish result
    else Replaced UID or newer version
        K-->>B: Conflict, retain current status
        B->>K: Reread on a later pass
    end
